///   q_full  (n_head, 2*head_dim) f32  the raw `attn_q` projection, BEFORE any norm
///   gate    = q_full[h][head_dim + d]  - the SECOND half of each head's 2*head_dim block
///   out     (n_head, head_dim) fp16
